---
import config from '../../../../site.config.json';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const booking=config.navigation.find(x=>x.id==='booking');
const service=config.navigation.find(x=>x.id==='services');
const contact=booking||service||config.navigation[0];
const href=base+(contact?.path??contact?.id+'/');
---
<div class="companion-site" data-assembled-layout="companion">
  <section class="companion-intro"><div><p class="companion-eyebrow">A NOTE FOR THE DAYS THAT FEEL FULL</p><h1>{config.brand.name}<i>{config.brand.tagline}</i></h1><p>這裡是一個認識服務者與合作方式的起點。你可以先閱讀，不需要立即做決定。</p><a href="#companion-letter">讀一封寫給你的信 ↓</a><p class="companion-signature">慢慢來，<br/>留一點空間給自己。</p></div><figure>{config.brand.heroImagePath?<img src={base+config.brand.heroImagePath.replace(/^\//,'')} alt={config.brand.heroImageAlt||'請填入圖片描述'}/>:<div class="companion-art" role="img" aria-label="暖色室內花草與窗影的幾何示意插畫"><span>✳</span></div>}<figcaption>示範視覺。可以替換成經授權的真實服務空間照片。</figcaption></figure></section>
  <article class="companion-letter" id="companion-letter"><aside><span>一封沒有催促的信</span><span>關於第一次理解彼此</span><span>DEMO / 請替換</span></aside><div><p class="companion-greeting">你好，</p><p>或許你正在了解不同的支持方式，還不知道什麼適合自己。這封信只是示範結構，不代表任何服務者的承諾或療效。</p><p>正式網站請用自己的語言說明服務範圍、可提供的支持、合作界線與聯絡方式。沒有資格或經驗資料時，請保持空白或標示待補。</p><p class="companion-signoff">願你保有選擇的空間，<br/>—— 請填入你的署名</p></div></article>
  <section class="companion-process"><p class="companion-eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE ABOUT THE PROCESS</p><h2>不必急著開始，<i>先了解會發生什麼。</i></h2><div class="companion-steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>先問一般問題</h3><p>可先詢問服務方式及合作流程。</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>確認期待和界線</h3><p>由實際服務者說明適合情況與限制。</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>把決定留給自己</h3><p>了解之後，再決定是否需要聯絡。</p></article></div><a href={href}>了解聯絡方式 ↗</a></section>
  <section class="companion-contact"><div><p class="companion-eyebrow">A QUIET WAY TO BEGIN</p><h2>如果願意，可以先從一個問題開始。</h2></div><p>目前沒有啟用預約或表單；請由站長設置安全的正式服務。</p><a href={href}>查看聯絡資訊 ↗</a></section>
</div>
<style>
.companion-site{--companion-ink:var(--ink,#4b312d);--companion-accent:var(--brand,#a66b5b);background:var(--bg,#fbf5ed);color:var(--companion-ink);padding:0 clamp(1rem,5vw,5rem) 5rem;font-family:var(--brand-heading-font,Georgia,serif)}.companion-site section,.companion-site article{max-width:1240px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}.companion-eyebrow{font:.73rem ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--companion-accent)}.companion-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:6vw;align-items:center;padding:5rem 0 7rem;position:relative}.companion-intro h1{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,6.5vw,6.4rem);line-height:1.1;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.06em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.companion-intro h1 i{display:block;font-size:.55em;font-weight:400;color:var(--companion-accent);margin-top:.3em}.companion-intro>div>p:not(.companion-eyebrow):not(.companion-signature){max-width:530px;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.95}.companion-intro a,.companion-process>a{display:inline-flex;padding:.5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--companion-accent);text-decoration:none}.companion-intro figure{margin:0}.companion-intro img,.companion-art{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;border-radius:44% 44% 4px 4px;filter:var(--brand-image-filter,none)}.companion-art{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 67% 36%,#e5c3a8 0 14%,transparent 15%),linear-gradient(125deg,#f0d8c0,#bea38f);display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:center;padding:1rem}.companion-art span{font-size:5rem;color:#805a4c;opacity:.7}.companion-intro figcaption{text-align:right;font:.75rem ui-monospace,monospace;margin-top:.6rem}.companion-signature{color:var(--companion-accent);font-style:italic;line-height:1.8;transform:rotate(-3deg);margin-top:2rem}
.companion-letter{max-width:1030px!important;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 85%,var(--brand));padding:2rem clamp(1.2rem,6vw,5rem);display:grid;grid-template-columns:.6fr 1.4fr;gap:5vw;position:relative;margin-bottom:6rem!important}.companion-letter:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:38%;height:100%;border-left:1px dashed color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 35%,transparent)}.companion-letter aside{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;font:.74rem ui-monospace,monospace}.companion-letter>div{font:1.08rem/2 var(--brand-body-font,system-ui,sans-serif)}.companion-greeting{font-size:1.45rem}.companion-signoff{color:var(--companion-accent);margin-top:2rem}
.companion-process{text-align:center;margin-bottom:6rem}.companion-process h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,5rem);line-height:1.12;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.05em;max-width:880px;margin:1rem auto 3rem}.companion-process h2 i{color:var(--companion-accent)}.companion-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);text-align:left;border-block:1px solid currentColor}.companion-steps article{padding:1.5rem}.companion-steps article+article{border-left:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 25%,transparent)}.companion-steps span{font:.75rem ui-monospace,monospace}.companion-steps h3{font-size:1.25rem}.companion-steps p{font: .95rem/1.8 var(--brand-body-font,system-ui,sans-serif)}
.companion-contact{border-top:1px solid currentColor;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr auto;gap:2rem;align-items:end;padding:2rem 0}.companion-contact h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.6rem);line-height:1.2;font-weight:400}.companion-contact>a{white-space:nowrap;color:inherit}
@media(max-width:800px){.companion-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:3rem 0}.companion-intro figure{max-width:650px;margin-left:auto;width:85%}.companion-letter{grid-template-columns:1fr}.companion-letter:before{display:none}.companion-contact{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:550px){.companion-intro h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,11vw,4.7rem)}.companion-intro figure{width:100%}.companion-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.companion-steps article+article{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid currentColor}.companion-contact{gap:.5rem}.companion-letter{padding:1.3rem}}
</style>
